<title>UK: Landesgirokasse sets 2.0 bln Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>Landesgirokasse sets 2.0 bln Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Societe Generale and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESGIROKASSE</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    04.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.05    PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.375    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED OCT 2006 AND OCT 2008 OATS -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
